  "answer_text": "Good news \u2014 **Miraculous Ladybug Season 2, Episode 12 has already aired!** It is not a future release. Here are the details depending on which episode listing you're referring to:\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcfa Season 2, Episode 12 \u2014 **\"Gorizilla\"**\nSeason 2, Episode 12 aired on **May 13, 2018**. In this episode, Adrien's bodyguard gets akumatized into Gorizilla, who is endowed with extraordinary strength and an acute sense of smell and tracks Adrien all through Paris.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcfa Season 2, Episode 12 (by production order) \u2014 **\"Sapotis\"**\nOn the official Miraculous website, Episode 12 is listed as **\"Sapotis\"**. During a sleepover at Alya's place, Alya's little sisters Etta and Ella won't stop making mischief. When Alya punishes them, the twins get akumatized by Hawk Moth and become Sapotis \u2014 small, out-of-control monsters who multiply upon eating and wreak havoc across the city.\n\n---\n\nSince episode numbering can vary depending on the platform or region, both of these episodes have **already been released**. You can watch them on platforms like **Disney+** or **Netflix**! \ud83d\ude0a",
